{"title":"CEMC Canadian Computing Competition","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>CEMC Canadian Computing Competition</b> (<b>CEMC CCC</b>) is a computing competition from <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"CEMC\">CEMC</a>.\n</p><p>It has been split into <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_CCC_Junior&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CEMC CCC Junior (page does not exist)\">CEMC CCC Junior</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_CCC_Senior&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CEMC CCC Senior (page does not exist)\">CEMC CCC Senior</a> ever since 2000.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problems_and_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problems and Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#1996-1999\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">1996-1999</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#2000-\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2000-</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Past_Results\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Past Results</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problems_and_Solutions\">Problems and Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Canadian_Computing_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problems and Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"1996-1999\">1996-1999</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Canadian_Computing_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: 1996-1999\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>See <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_CCC_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"CEMC CCC Problems and Solutions\">CEMC CCC Problems and Solutions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2000-\">2000-</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Canadian_Computing_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: 2000-\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_CCC_Junior_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"CEMC CCC Junior Problems and Solutions\">CEMC CCC Junior Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_CCC_Senior_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"CEMC CCC Senior Problems and Solutions\">CEMC CCC Senior Problems and Solutions</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Past_Results\">Past Results</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Canadian_Computing_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Past Results\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_CCC_Past_Results\" title=\"CEMC CCC Past Results\">CEMC CCC Past Results</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Canadian_Computing_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Beaver_Computing_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Beaver Computing Competition\">CEMC Beaver Computing Competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Canadian_Computing_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CEMC Canadian Computing Olympiad (page does not exist)\">CEMC Canadian Computing Olympiad</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Canadian_Computing_Competition&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018065842\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 28/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 346/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.180      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.180      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35871:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018065842 and revision id 281001. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}